  = note: C17 7.22.3.1 p2 and 7.22.3.4 p2 leave what `aligned_alloc` and `malloc` allocate indeterminate until something writes it, and Annex J.2 lists using that value as undefined
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = note: this could not be proven, and unproven results are errors in this compilation
  = help: assign it on every path before it is read
